WEBVTT

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:02.736
to contribute to the solutions
of urbanization

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.096
and to provide us
with better environments.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.496
It's not that long ago

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:11.256
that our lighting was just done
with these kinds of lamps.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:13.376
And of course,
we had the metal-halide lamps

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.496
and fluorescent lamps
and things like that.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.016
Now we have LED,

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:21.096
but here you see the latest one,
and you see how incredibly small it is.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:24.736
And this is exactly
what offers us a unique opportunity,

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:27.976
because this tiny, tiny size allows us

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.336
to put the light
wherever we really need it.